    {
      "id": "game-description-bfcf3b65-18ad-4b89-b04a-3a9c1baede49-0",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Track and field groups contests of running, jumping, and throwing within a shared athletics setting. Races compare finishing times and order, while field events measure height or distance. Combined events test performance across several disciplines rather than one specialty."
    },
    {
      "id": "game-description-bfcf3b65-18ad-4b89-b04a-3a9c1baede49-1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "Although running and throwing contests have ancient histories, modern track and field developed through standardized events, equipment, measurement, and organized competition. It is a family of sports rather than a single game, so there is no one creator, publisher, or release date."
    },
